cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "rpsi-proof: SAT Certification for Rψ(5,5) ≤ 16"
abstract: |
  Formal SAT-based certification system for Vibrational Ramsey numbers
  using symbiotic resonance encoding. This package generates DIMACS CNF
  instances to verify bounds on Rψ(r,s) - Ramsey numbers under vibrational
  coherent coloring based on frequency 141.7001 Hz (QCAL ∞³ field).
  
  The main instance Rψ(5,5) ≤ 16 has 120 variables (edges of K₁₆) and
  8,736 clauses (constraints to avoid monochromatic K₅ cliques).
  
  Method: Deterministic coloring via resonance operator, not random coloring.
  Result: Polynomial growth O(√(rs) × ln(rs)) vs exponential R(r,s).
